# Allow only the files needed by the image build. In particular, exclude local
# datasets, virtual environments, logs, Git history, and deployment secrets.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!notices/
!notices/**
!src/
!src/zebramotif/
!src/zebramotif/**
!deploy/
!deploy/start.sh
src/zebramotif/data/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
